    "https://wustl.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/job/St-Louis-MO/Director-Clinical-Operations---Neurosurgery_JR96874": {
      "title": "Director Clinical Operations - Neurosurgery",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-27\nPosted: Posted 12 Days Ago\nFull time\n\nLocation ST. LOUIS, MO 63108&#xa;&#xa; Scheduled Hours 40 Position Summary Manages the implementation of the clinical operations plans by coordinating the delivery of clinical services. Job Description Primary Duties & Responsibilities: Oversees advanced practice providers. Manages patient service operations. Oversees patient scheduling. Facilitates the implementation of new physician practice models for clinical operations. Coordinates the development of operational and space plans to support the physician practice models. Recommends adjustments as necessary. Assists with the coordination of new and existing programs. Assists with the design of integrated systems and processes to support clinical operations including registration, scheduling and electronic medical records. Assists in the implementation of the staffing model and the coordination of the clinical staff. Interacts with clinical departments on a regular basis. Maintains a service environment for faculty and staff. Develop, maintain and enhance good working relationships with external and internal constituents. Stays abreast of changing regulations that may impact clinical operations. Performs other duties as assigned. Working Conditions: Job Location/Working Conditions Normal Office Environment Physical Effort Typically Sitting at a desk or table Equipment Office Equipment The above statements are intended to describe the general nature and level of work performed by people assigned to this classification. They are not intended to be construed as an exhaustive list of all job duties performed by the personnel so classified. Management reserves the right to revise or amend duties at any time. Required Qualifications Education: Bachelor's degree Certifications /Professional Licenses : No specific certification/professional license is required for this position. Work Experience: Academic Health Center, Hospital, Or Healt