      "title": "Accounting Assistant II - Arts and Sciences, Psychological & Brain Sciences",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-07-16\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nFull time\n\nLocation ST. LOUIS, MO 63130&#xa;&#xa; Scheduled Hours 37.5 Position Summary This position provides transactional and administrative support to the departments and programs in assigned department. Job Description Primary Duties & Responsibilities: This position provides transaction and administrative support to the Psychological and Brain Sciences and the programs associated with the department. Initiates/review and upload supporting documentation for purchasing transactions. Processes spend authorizations and expense reports for travel. Process reimbursement requests for department members in your assigned profile. Reviews and processes Procard transactions for approval. Processes internal and external invoices. Monitors account balances, process necessary journals and budget adjustments. Maintains documentation of transaction in accordance with internal and external retention and compliance policies. Provides general office support including supporting human subject payments. Performs other duties as assigned. Working Conditions: Job Location/Working Conditions Normal Office Environment Physical Effort Typically sitting at a desk or table The above statements are intended to describe the general nature and level of work performed by people assigned to this classification. They are not intended to be construed as an exhaustive list of all job duties performed by the personnel so classified. Management reserves the right to revise or amend duties at any time. Required Qualifications Education: High school diploma or equivalent high school certification or combination of education and/or experience. Certifications /Professional Licenses : No specific certification/professional license is required for this position. Work Experience: Office, Payroll, Accounting, Or Business (2 Years) Skills: Not Applicable Driver's License: A driver's license is not required for this position. More 